[2026-05-31 00:53:10] [INFO] [SubagentStop] Input: {"session_id":"9f5795ac-3f93-48e9-9874-a8bef5d85f5a","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\9f5795ac-3f93-48e9-9874-a8bef5d85f5a.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"default","agent_id":"a47cda758b1f1eb2b","agent_type":"Explore","hook_event_name":"SubagentStop","stop_hook_active":false,"agent_transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\9f5795ac-3f93-48e9-9874-a8bef5d85f5a\\subagents\\agent-a47cda758b1f1eb2b.jsonl","last_assistant_message":"## Summary of Findings\n\nBased on my search of the codebase, here are the key findings about `trace-init` and `session/register` endpoints:\n\n### 1. `/api/proxy/trace-init` Endpoint\n\n**Definition**: Located in `claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/proxy_handler.go`\n\n- **Handler**: `ProxyHandler.TraceInit()` (lines 84-126)\n- **Method**: POST\n- **Purpose**: Forwards trace-init requests to all registered proxies\n- **Process**:\n  1. Reads the request body\n  2. Gets all registered proxies from memory\n  3. Forwards the request to each proxy's `/_internal/trace-init` endpoint\n  4. Returns the first successful response\n\n**Registration**: Located in `claude_tap_plus/cmd/claude-tap/backend_autostart.go`\n\n- **Function**: `registerProxyWithBackend()` (lines 124-135)\n- **Process**: Registers proxy with backend using process ID and proxy URL\n- **Storage**: Maintains proxy list in memory during runtime\n\n### 2. `/api/session/register` Endpoint\n\n**Definition**: Located in `claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/session_handler.go`\n\n- **Handler**: `SessionHandler.Register()` (lines 23-72)\n- **Method**: POST\n- **Purpose**: Registers a new session with the backend\n- **Required Fields**:\n  - session_id\n  - machine_id\n  - project_slug\n  - transcript_path\n- **Storage**: Persists session data to database through service layer\n\n### 3. Proxy Trace File Creation Logic\n\n**Internal Endpoint**: `/_internal/trace-init` in `claude_tap_plus/internal/proxy/reverse.go`\n\n- **Handler**: `ReverseProxy.handleTraceInit()` (lines 394-462)\n- **Method**: POST\n- **Process**:\n  1. Receives session info (session_id, machine_id, project_slug, transcript_path)\n  2. Creates trace file path: `{baseDir}/{machine_id}/{project_slug}/{session_id}.jsonl`\n  3. Creates a new TraceWriter for the session\n  4. Calls session initialization callback (registers to proxy.json)\n\n### 4. Shell Script Integration\n\n**Session Start Hook**: `.claude/hooks/01-session-start/base.sh`\n\n- **Lines 84-127**: `init_trace_path()` function\n- **Process**:\n  1. Reads backend info from `~/.claude-tap-plus/backend.json`\n  2. Extracts session_id from Claude metadata\n  3. Determines machine_id and project_slug\n  4. Calls `POST /api/proxy/trace-init` with session info\n  5. Logs trace path from response\n\n- **Lines 130-176**: `register_session()` function\n- **Process**:\n  1. Calls `POST /api/session/register` with complete session details\n  2. Includes session_id, machine_id, os, project_slug, cwd, etc.\n\n### 5. Flow Architecture\n\n```\nClaude Code (session start)\n    ↓\n01-session-start/base.sh hook\n    ↓\n┌─────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────┐\n│                         │                         │\n▼                         ▼\n/api/proxy/trace-init      /api/session/register\n│                         │\n▼                         ▼\nProxyHandler.TraceInit    SessionHandler.Register\n│                         │\n└───> To all proxies       └───> Store to DB\n        │\n        ▼\nReverseProxy.handleTraceInit\n        │\n        ▼\nCreate trace file: {baseDir}/{machine_id}/{project_slug}/{session_id}.jsonl\n```\n\n### 6. Key Files and Locations\n\n1. **Backend API Routes**: `claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/router.go`\n   - Line 40: `/api/proxy/trace-init` route\n   - Line 31: `/api/session/register` route\n\n2. **Proxy Handler**: `claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/proxy_handler.go`\n   - Lines 84-126: `TraceInit()` method\n\n3. **Session Handler**: `claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/session_handler.go`\n   - Lines 23-72: `Register()` method\n\n4. **Proxy Internal**: `claude_tap_plus/internal/proxy/reverse.go`\n   - Lines 394-462: `handleTraceInit()` method\n   - Creates actual trace files\n\n5. **Shell Hook**: `.claude/hooks/01-session-start/base.sh`\n   - Lines 111-118: Calls `/api/proxy/trace-init`\n   - Lines 162-171: Calls `/api/session/register`\n\n6. **Autostart**: `claude_tap_plus/cmd/claude-tap/backend_autostart.go`\n   - Lines 124-135: Proxy registration logic\n\n7. **Test Files**:\n   - `claude_tap_plus/tests/e2e/proxy_trace_test.go`: E2E tests for trace functionality\n   - `claude_tap_plus/tests/backend/session_api_test.go`: Session API tests\n\nThe system follows a clear separation where the backend acts as a coordinator that forwards trace-init requests to all proxies, while each proxy is responsible for creating its own trace files when it receives the trace-init request.","background_tasks":[],"session_crons":[]}
