lug}/{session_id}.jsonl`\n  3. Creates a new TraceWriter for the session\n  4. Calls session initialization callback (registers to proxy.json)\n\n### 4. Shell Script Integration\n\n**Session Start Hook**: `.claude/hooks/01-session-start/base.sh`\n\n- **Lines 84-127**: `init_trace_path()` function\n- **Process**:\n  1. Reads backend info from `~/.claude-tap-plus/backend.json`\n  2. Extracts session_id from Claude metadata\n  3. Determines machine_id and project_slug\n  4. Calls `POST /api/proxy/trace-init` with session info\n  5. Logs trace path from response\n\n- **Lines 130-176**: `register_session()` function\n- **Process**:\n  1. Calls `POST /api/session/register` with complete session details\n  2. Includes session_id, machine_id, os, project_slug, cwd, etc.\n\n### 5. Flow Architecture\n\n```\nClaude Code (session start)\n    ↓\n01-session-start/base.sh hook\n    ↓\n┌─────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────┐\n│                         │                         │\n▼                         ▼\n/api/proxy/trace-init      /api/session/register\n│                         │\n▼                         ▼\nProxyHandler.TraceInit    SessionHandler.Register\n│                         │\n└───> To all proxies       └───> Store to DB\n        │\n        ▼\nReverseProxy.handleTraceInit\n        │\n        ▼\nCreate trace file: {baseDir}/{machine_id}/{project_slug}/{session_id}.jsonl\n```\n\n### 6. Key Files and Locations\n\n1. **Backend API Routes**: `claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/router.go`\n   - Line 40: `/api/proxy/trace-init` route\n   - Line 31: `/api/session/register` route\n\n2. **Proxy Handler**: `claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/proxy_handler.go`\n   - Lines 84-126: `TraceInit()` method\n\n3. **Session Handler**: `claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/session_handler.go`\n   - Lines 23-72: `Register()` method\n\n4. **Proxy Internal**: `claude_tap_plus/internal/proxy/reverse.go`\n   - Lines 394-462: `handleTraceInit()` method\n   - Creates actual trace files\n\n5. **Shell Hook**: `.claude/hooks/01-session-start/base.sh`\n   - Lines 111-118: Calls `/api/proxy/trace-init`\n   - Lines 162-171: Calls `/api/session/register`\n\n6. **Autostart**: `claude_tap_plus/cmd/claude-tap/backend_autostart.go`\n   - Lines 124-135: Proxy registration logic\n\n7. **Test Files**:\n   - `claude_tap_plus/tests/e2e/proxy_trace_test.go`: E2E tests for trace functionality\n   - `claude_tap_plus/tests/backend/session_api_test.go`: Session API tests\n\nThe system follows a clear separation where the backend acts as a coordinator that forwards trace-init requests to all proxies, while each proxy is responsible for creating its own trace files when it receives the trace-init request."}],"totalDurationMs":53154,"totalTokens":74145,"totalToolUseCount":22,"usage":{"input_tokens":7416,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":64949,"output_tokens":1780,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":13,"searchCount":9,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"tool_use_id":"call_6ead374ebc0b46ab96277dd7","duration_ms":53155}
