[2026-05-31 10:53:31] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"7b2b89f2-ee5f-44be-9351-b88ec9fac19c","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\7b2b89f2-ee5f-44be-9351-b88ec9fac19c.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"default","agent_id":"a9143678f1e296400","agent_type":"Explore","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-1-issue-init\\SKILL.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-1-issue-init\\SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: 003-1-issue-init\ndescription: 初始化 GitHub 项目的 issue 标签体系（一次性）\nuser-invocable: true\nallowed-tools:\n  - Bash\n  - Read\n  - Write\n---\n\n# Issue Init Skill\n\n初始化当前 GitHub 项目的 issue 标签体系。\n\n## 规则\n\n1. 只能执行一次，重复执行提示已初始化\n2. 标签来源：本目录下 `labels.conf`，不使用其他标签\n3. 已存在的标签跳过，不覆盖颜色和描述\n4. 后续更新：修改 `labels.conf` 后重新运行会增量添加\n\n## 操作流程\n\n1. 检查 `.github/.issue-initialized` 标记文件是否存在\n2. 读取 `labels.conf` 中的标签定义\n3. 获取 GitHub remote 信息（owner/repo）\n4. 逐条创建标签：`gh label create <name> --color <color> --description <desc>`\n5. 创建标记文件 `.github/.issue-initialized`\n6. 输出初始化结果\n\n## gh 命令参考\n\n```bash\n# 创建标签\ngh label create \"bug\" --color \"d73a4a\" --description \"Something isn't working\"\n\n# 列出已有标签\ngh label list\n\n# 删除多余标签\ngh label delete \"wontfix\" --yes\n```\n","numLines":43,"startLine":1,"totalLines":43}},"tool_use_id":"call_59a0d4b60ace49d682ec1133","duration_ms":0}
