[2026-05-31 10:53:32] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"7b2b89f2-ee5f-44be-9351-b88ec9fac19c","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\7b2b89f2-ee5f-44be-9351-b88ec9fac19c.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"default","agent_id":"a9143678f1e296400","agent_type":"Explore","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-3-issue-discuss\\SKILL.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\.claude\\skills\\003-3-issue-discuss\\SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: 003-3-issue-discuss\ndescription: 拉取 GitHub Issue 内容进行讨论，支持评论互动\nuser-invocable: true\nallowed-tools:\n  - Bash\n  - Read\n  - Write\n---\n\n# Issue 讨论 Skill\n\n拉取指定 issue 的完整内容（标题、描述、评论、标签），注入到当前会话作为上下文，用于方案讨论。\n\n## 操作流程\n\n1. 用户输入 `/003-3-issue-discuss #N`\n2. 拉取 issue 内容：`gh issue view N`\n3. 拉取评论：`gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues/N/comments`\n4. 将完整内容注入会话上下文\n5. 用户在会话中讨论方案\n6. 讨论结论通过 `gh issue comment N --body \"...\"` 写入\n\n## 规则\n\n1. 必须指定 issue 编号\n2. 拉取内容包括：title、body、labels、assignees、state、所有 comments\n3. 讨论结论以 comment 形式写回 issue\n\n## gh 命令参考\n\n```bash\n# 查看详情\ngh issue view <编号>\n\n# 查看评论\ngh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues/<编号>/comments --jq '.[].body'\n\n# 发表评论\ngh issue comment <编号> --body \"<内容>\"\n```\n","numLines":42,"startLine":1,"totalLines":42}},"tool_use_id":"call_557f69a4187340169174a528","duration_ms":9}
