Glob, Grep\n- **触发方式**: `/003-8-issue-test`\n\n### 11. **003-9-issue-review**\n- **description**: 审核 PR：合并或打回\n- **allowed-tools**: Bash, Read\n- **触发方式**: `/003-9-issue-review`\n\n### 12. **004-git-push**\n- **description**: 按规范格式提交代码并推送到远程仓库（commit + push）\n- **allowed-tools**: Bash, Read, Glob, Grep\n- **触发方式**: `/004-git-push`\n\n### 13. **005-git-commit**\n- **description**: 按规范格式提交代码到本地仓库（仅 commit，不推送）\n- **allowed-tools**: Bash, Read, Edit, Glob, Grep\n- **触发方式**: `/005-git-commit`\n\n### 14. **999-other-110-requirement-planning**\n- **description**: 轻量级文档生成技能，将用户功能需求拆解为前端页面组文档和领域模块文档。当用户提供功能需求描述，需要生成PRD页面文档或领域文档时触发。\n- **allowed-tools**: 无明确列出（通过技能描述可见需要文档生成功能）\n- **触发方式**: `/999-other-110-requirement-planning`\n\n## 说明\n\n1. **003 系列技能**：完整覆盖了 GitHub Issue 的全流程管理（初始化→创建→讨论→领取→修复→完成→PR→测试→审核）\n2. **Git 技能**：区分了本地提交（005）和提交推送（004）两种操作\n3. **文档技能**：包含测试代码管理（001）和文档归档（002）功能\n4. **需求规划**：999 技能专注于将功能需求拆解为前端页面和领域模块文档"}],"totalDurationMs":54132,"totalTokens":50344,"totalToolUseCount":14,"usage":{"input_tokens":8606,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":40234,"output_tokens":1504,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":14,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"tool_use_id":"call_12c69726940e4054b40c318d","duration_ms":54132}
