sh` 在Windows环境下调用\n\n**关键逻辑流程：**\n1. 检查是否为Windows环境\n2. 使用Python解析工具输入命令（截取前80字符）\n3. 获取项目目录名作为匹配hint\n4. 调用PowerShell脚本将终端窗口前置到前台\n5. 记录工具调用和命令信息\n\n## 系统架构关系图\n\n```\nClaude Code\n    ├── Hook 05 (PreToolUse) → 05-pre-tool-use/base.sh → enforce_boundary.sh (A层拦截)\n    │                                        └── dispatch_to_skill (B层拦截)\n    │\n    ├── Hook 06 (PermissionRequest) → 06-permission-request/base.sh → win32-foreground.sh\n    │                                                                └── win32-foreground.ps1\n    │\n    └── Hook 16 (Stop) → 16-stop/base.sh\n                          ├── skill-register.sh (自动注册)\n                          ├── .active.sh + 16Stop.sh (skill清理)\n                          └── task-complete-notify.sh → win32-foreground.ps1\n```\n\n这个hook系统实现了一个分层的安全模型和生命周期管理，通过不同的hook点在工具调用前后、权限请求、会话结束时执行相应的业务逻辑。"}],"totalDurationMs":64209,"totalTokens":40197,"totalToolUseCount":11,"usage":{"input_tokens":1243,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":36997,"output_tokens":1957,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":8,"searchCount":3,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"tool_use_id":"call_660670718e5043b3a02aae06","duration_ms":64209}
